---
<section class="relative overflow-x-hidden">
  <svg
    class="absolute top-0 right-0 blur-3xl opacity-80"
    width="50%"
    height="100%"
    viewBox="0 0 400 400"
    fill="none"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <g clip-path="url(#clip0_17_60)">
      <g filter="url(#filter0_f_17_60)">
        <path d="M128.6 0H0V322.2L332.5 211.5L128.6 0Z" fill="#4D07E3"></path>
        <path d="M0 322.2V400H240H320L332.5 211.5L0 322.2Z" fill="#4C00FF"
        ></path>
        <path d="M320 400H400V78.75L332.5 211.5L320 400Z" fill="#B5BFF1"></path>
        <path d="M400 0H128.6L332.5 211.5L400 78.75V0Z" fill="#7fcef3"></path>
      </g>
    </g>
    <defs>
      <filter
        id="filter0_f_17_60"
        x="-159.933"
        y="-159.933"
        width="719.867"
        height="719.867"
        filterUnits="userSpaceOnUse"
        color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feFlood flood-opacity="0" result="BackgroundImageFix"></feFlood>
        <feBlend
          mode="normal"
          in="SourceGraphic"
          in2="BackgroundImageFix"
          result="shape"></feBlend>
        <feGaussianBlur
          stdDeviation="79.9667"
          result="effect1_foregroundBlur_17_60"></feGaussianBlur>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</section>
<section class="relative">
  <div class="relative px-8 py-12 mt-12 mx-auto max-w-7xl md:px-12 lg:px-16">
    <div class="prose prose-blockquote:border-l-white prose-a:text-indigo-400 hover:prose-a:text-white prose-headings:font-normal prose-headings:text-white prose-li:marker:text-indigo-500 text-vulcan-300 prose-code:text-white prose-blockquote:text-white/70 max-w-none">      
      <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
        OVERVIEW
      </h2>

<p>
  Solstice is a premium retailer specializing in luxury fashion and lifestyle products, offering a seamless shopping experience across both their physical stores and eCommerce platform. They use Heartland Retail POS in-store and Shopify Plus for their online store, allowing them to cater to an expansive customer base. However, their existing gift card system was limited, and they sought an omnichannel solution that could integrate more sophisticated promotional and loyalty capabilities across all channels.
</p>
     
       <h2
        id="description-all-the-terms-that-you-agree-to-when-you-sign-up-for-a-Lexington-product-">
              <h2 id="account-terms">CHALLENGE</h2>
      </h2>
    <p>
      Solstice wanted to implement an omnichannel promotional and loyalty gift card system that would allow them to:
    </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <p>
        Link gift cards to customer profiles, enabling follow-up and ensuring redemption.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        Launch cross-channel promotions (e.g., spend $X and receive $X toward future purchases).
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        Allow customers to use and redeem gift cards both in-store and online with seamless integration between Heartland POS and Shopify Plus.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        Automate the management of promo cards with time-sensitive validation and control over loading during transactions.
      </p>             
    </li>
    <li>
      <p>
        Save time on manual processes while growing key business metrics like ARR, LTV, AOV, and repeat purchases.
      </p>             
    </li>
  </ul> 
    <p>
      With their current bare-bones gift card system, Solstice needed a third-party solution that could be integrated into their existing infrastructure to deliver these functionalities.
    </p>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
      <img alt="Solstice Sunglasses" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/solstice1.webp">
    </div>
<div class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <RoundedGrid />
  </div>
      <h2 id="account-terms">SOLUTION </h2>
      <h2>Custom Gift Card and Promotional System Integration</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>
          <h3>Omnichannel Gift Card Integration:</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Linking Gift Cards to Customer Profiles:</h3>
            <p>
              One of Solstice's key deliverables was to be able to track customer engagement and ensure the redemption of gift cards. The new system allowed each gift card number to be linked directly to a customer's profile in both Heartland POS and Shopify Plus. This integration enabled Solstice to follow up with customers who hadn’t redeemed their gift cards, increasing the likelihood of conversion and customer retention.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Seamless Cross-Channel Usage:</h3>
            <p>
              Customers could purchase, redeem, and reload gift cards both online and in-store. Gift card balances were updated in real-time, ensuring consistency across all channels. Whether a customer bought a card in-store or online, it was instantly accessible on either platform, eliminating the need for manual updates.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Promotional Gift Cards and Campaigns:</h3>
          <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Automated Promotional Gift Cards:</h3>
            <p>
              Solstice implemented promotional gift card campaigns where customers would receive a reward for spending a certain amount within a predetermined timeframe. For example:
            </p>
            <ul>
          <li>
            <h3>Spend $200, Get $20 Promo Card</h3>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Spend $400, Get $40 Promo Card</h3>
          </li>
          </ul>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              These promo cards were designed to be valid through a specific period (e.g., through 12/31/2023), and the new system automated this process, making it easy to manage deadlines, load amounts, and ensure the cards were redeemed before expiration.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Customization and Flexibility:</h3>
            <p>
              The system allowed promo cards to either be pre-loaded with a value or loaded dynamically at the POS during the transaction, depending on the promotion. This gave Solstice the flexibility to run both large-scale, pre-determined promotions and more personalized, on-the-spot incentives.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      <li>
          <h3>Integration Between Heartland POS and Shopify Plus:</h3>
            <ul>
            <li>
            <h3>Real-Time Synchronization:</h3>
            <p>
              To ensure consistency between physical and online sales, the system integrated Heartland Retail POS with Shopify Plus, providing a unified experience for the customer. This included real-time updates on gift card balances, promo card issuance, and redemption tracking, allowing customers to seamlessly transition between in-store and online purchases.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Reduced Manual Work:</h3>
            <p>
              Before the integration, Solstice’s team spent considerable time manually managing gift card balances and promotional cards. The automated system saved hours of administrative work, eliminating the need for manual data entry or reconciliation between platforms.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Enhanced Customer Engagement and Loyalty:</h3>
            <ul>
            <li>
            <h3>Promotional Follow-Up:</h3>
            <p>
              By linking gift cards and promo cards to customer profiles, Solstice could follow up via email, text, or app notifications to remind customers of unused cards or upcoming expiration dates. These personalized follow-ups encouraged repeat purchases and created a more engaging customer experience.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Loyalty Integration:</h3>
            <p>
              The new system also allowed Solstice to tie their gift card campaigns into their broader loyalty program, further rewarding loyal customers with bonus gift cards or special promo cards. This encouraged more frequent purchases and strengthened relationships with their top customers.
            </p>
          </li>
          </ul>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center">
        <img alt="Solstice Sunglasses" class="rounded-lg mt-2 shadow-2xl shadow-vulcan-950/50" width="1000" height="532" src="/assets/case-study/solstice.png">
      </div>
      
